  "semantics": [
    "一份WeakMap按原夜状态身份持同array，append/read/Frame共用，不另建source/permission/current/stock；public仅reader，非空fixture登记private。",
    "首次分配晚于原Pipeline构造与旧dreamLinks属性/getter/prototype/clone注入API退休明确声明；只读只是TS数组视图，首read登记非无副作用。",
    "producer原history→uses→nightCommit→applied→array push lookup→link/captureRadiantPaidEffect→fact保；两个故障unit在真实晚lookup装故障，保原付款前缀。",
    "composition原constructor callee→原claims identity→shelters→Scholar recheck→solver顺序保；旧gettertrace只移退役节点而原solver/World/错误oracle保。",
    "Frame+八个原直接constructor消费者全原字节；3新case覆盖同ref/lazy/getter退休/Frame后append与真实已付失败，无新角色规则或回滚。",
    "原paid-radiant场景在开局preset早红且真实7d61隔离690source同红；不当迁移回归或绿色，完整旧actions/errors/状态/fact oracles保，后续独立修fixture。"
  ],
